---
// What the team looks after and what the couple brings.
import { img } from '@lib/paths';
---
<section class="care_page_wrap u-section u-theme-light" aria-labelledby="care-title">
  <div class="care_page_contain u-container">
    <div class="split_block_layout">
      <img {...img("celebrations/coordinator.webp", 900)} class="split_block_image" alt="A woman in a dark linen dress setting a long table with candles and olive branches under the courtyard arches" width="900" height="1117" loading="lazy" />
      <div class="split_block_content">
        <h2 class="split_block_title u-text-style-h2" id="care-title">What we look after</h2>
        <p class="split_block_text">Neus Vallespir, our events coordinator, plans the day with you and stays until the last guest goes up to bed. Margalida Bauzà, our chef, writes the menu with you and plans a dish for each diet and allergy on your guest list. Book all 21 rooms and the house is yours, with breakfast for everyone the next morning.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="house_home_layout care_page_bring">
      <div class="house_home_head"><h2 class="house_home_title u-text-style-h2" id="bring-title">What you bring</h2></div>
      <div class="house_home_body"><p>For a legal ceremony, you'll need a wedding planner who knows the rules for your country. We work with them often and can share names.</p><p>Flowers, music and photography are yours to choose, and we'll send you suppliers who know the house.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
